msgid "Download New Wipes"
msgstr "Descargar novos limpadores…"

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_interface/menu/settings_menu/download_new_wipes.rst:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "This feature allows you to download and install files that can be used as Wipe files in the :ref:`wipe` transition.  These files are greyscale images in the pgm format."
msgid "This feature allows you to download and install files that can be used as Wipe files in the :doc:`/compositing/transitions/wipe` transition.  These files are greyscale images in the :file:`.pgm` format."
msgstr "Esta funcionalidade permite descargar e instalar ficheiros que poden usarse como limpadores nunha transición :ref:`limpadora <wipe>`. Os ficheiros son imaxes en escala de grises no formato PGM."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_interface/menu/settings_menu/download_new_wipes.rst:25
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "If you have your own wipe files that you would like to share with the community you can upload them to `store.kde.org <https://store.kde.org/browse/cat/185/>`_ which should make them available from this *Download New Wipes* function."
msgid "If you have your own wipe files that you would like to share with the community you can upload them to the |kde_store| which makes them available for other users of Kdenlive from this *Download New Wipes* function."
msgstr "Se ten ficheiros de limpadores seus que lle gustaría compartir coa comunidade, pode envialos a `store.kde.org <https://store.kde.org/browse/cat/185/>`_ para publicalos nesta función de descargar novos limpadores."
